   "title": "IDENTITY LOCK \u2014 who Seth is",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Image 1 is the drawing to edit, and the man in image 1 is the only character in the finished picture. Redraw him exactly as he is: a lanky cartoon man with long wavy shoulder-length brown hair and a full bushy handlebar moustache, wearing a plain v-neck t-shirt of very dark olive charcoal \u2014 near-black, the same flat dark tone as the t-shirt in image 1. Keep the shape of his face, his long wavy shoulder-length hair, his full bushy handlebar moustache, his dark v-neck t-shirt, the size and position of his head in the frame and the plain aged-paper background behind him identical to image 1, and keep every colour as muted and desaturated as image 1. One thing about him changes: his expression."
   ],
   "color": "#223",
   "bgcolor": "#335"
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
   "pos": [
